Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|false|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|YouTube|
		|testray.main.component.name|YouTube|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	Then Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add Youtube Video
Priority: 4
	Given Portlet add PG
		|portletName|YouTube|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|YouTube|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And YoutubePortlet add Video Id
		|videoId|PiObSymqSdo|
	And PortletEntry save
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
	And YoutubePortlet assert Video Title
		|videoTitle|The Gospel in 6 Minutes - John Piper|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletName|YouTube|
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And YoutubePortlet view Portlet Configuration
		|videoId|PiObSymqSdo|
	Then IFrame close Frame

Scenario: Youtube Portlet Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given Portlet add PG
		|portletName|YouTube|
	When Portlet view PG
		|portletBody|Please configure this portlet to make it visible to all users.|
		|portletName|YouTube|